A priced exchange records the old basis, both SEK trade values, and the new basis.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --id 8 --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity OLD
  format 1,000 OLD
commodity NEW
  format 1,000 NEW
account Assets:Shares
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Shares  2 OLD {{150 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -150 SEK

2024-02-01 Priced replacement
  Assets:Shares  5 NEW {{200 SEK}} @@ 200 SEK
  Assets:Shares  -2 OLD {{150 SEK}} @@ 200 SEK
  Income:Gains  -50 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-02-01 Priced replacement
    Assets:Shares                       5 NEW {40.00 SEK} @@ 200.00 SEK
    Assets:Shares                       -2 OLD {75.00 SEK} @@ 200.00 SEK
    Income:Gains                          -50.00 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========
